# Bind mounts for Waydroid's container (docs/waydroid-aosp17.md), one "SOURCE TARGET" per line.
# init's Waydroid first stage makes them before init splits its bootstrap and default mount
# namespaces; a mount from init.rc would stay in the bootstrap namespace in the container.
#
# Waydroid's composer and the HIDL service manager instead of the PC's composer APEX.
/vendor/etc/waydroid/composer-hidl.xml /vendor/etc/vintf/manifest/waydroid.xml
# No sensors sub-HAL, as on the PC (aosp-device/pc/init.pc.rc): Cuttlefish's asks its host over
# /dev/hvc* and SensorService then blocks system_server.
/vendor/etc/sensors/hals.pc.conf /vendor/etc/sensors/hals.conf
